<title>SPAIN: Spain's Popular to pay 202.50 ptas net dividend.</title>
<headline>Spain's Popular to pay 202.50 ptas net dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular said on Wednesday it would pay a third interim dividend against 1996 results of 202.50 pesetas net per share, effective April 5.</p>
<p>The gross dividend per share is 270 pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
